VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t04
GOAL
  first_word handles empty input.
CLAIM normal REQUIRED
  ENSURE normal sentence works
CLAIM empty REQUIRED
  ENSURE empty string returns empty
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY normal
  USING mini.t.first.normal
VERIFY empty
  USING mini.t.first.empty
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
